  (text "Design requirements:\n- 3V0A output @ 50 mA (tcxo for cc1200)\n- 3V3 output @ 700 mA\n  - See FCB V2 Math sheet\n- 3V9A output @ 1A (rffe)\n\n- 5v @ ???A for servos+cameras"
